{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "c9afced1455ffdacc25af7f0efc3ffb49c61642d732838b14fe16630a2317cbf", "ja": "この前作った保健だより、\n結構好評だったみたい♪\n今月も作ってみようかな？", "zh": "之前做的保健宣传海报，\n评价好像挺好的♪\n这个月要不要也做一张呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "e5e82a45d494c09489e25e2055d9fb308b34dcf9f7f24ec3f5803203ffc0e1d7", "ja": "えっと、今日やることは…。\n事務のお仕事と、劇場のお掃除。\nあとはグッズの発注、衣装作り…。", "zh": "我想想，今天要做的事有……\n事务工作、打扫剧场。\n然后是下订周边商品、制作服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "ee3d604bcb5f73e4ef5e8b1ca3fe1d90328b9c516e235c19ce5e03b4e15a34d4", "ja": "それと、社長さんが呼んでたって、\n{$P$}Pさんに、\nお知らせしなくちゃ！", "zh": "还有，要去通知\n{$P$}P先生\n社长在找他才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_chat_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "485b0870be56d27a38ada44119f7505a28575a2cb2f03ababd068fa5497f4243", "ja": "社会人って思ったより忙しいけど、\n毎日楽しいなぁ♪　よーし、\n今日も張り切っていこっと！", "zh": "出社会以后虽然比想像中的忙，\n但每天都过得很开心♪\n好～今天也鼓起干劲加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
